This folder contains the python source scripts to conduct the following the tasks:
1) Estimating yield strength of Alloy 718 using physics-informed strengthening models,
2) Training a Polynomial Chaos Expansion (PCE) surrogate model,
3) Validating the surrogate against experimental data and calibrating uncertainty using Bayesian calibration,
4) Performing inverse design of robust composition windows using Bayesian optimization (BayBE),
5) Extracting and visualizing Pareto-optimal design windows.
